<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>注册—消痕侠数字痕迹管理平台</title><link rel="icon" href="${docroot}/static/img/xhen-brand.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="${docroot}/static/css/fluent.css?v=competition-register-1">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="${docroot}/static/css/vault-motion.css?v=20261018"><script src="${docroot}/static/js/vault-scene.js?v=20261018" defer></script><script src="${docroot}/static/js/vault-motion.js?v=20261018" defer></script></head><body class="fluent-login fl-register"><main class="fl-auth-shell">
<section class="fl-auth-story"><div class="fl-brand"><span class="fl-brand-icon"><img src="${docroot}/static/img/xhen-brand.svg" alt="盾牌与扫描十字"></span><span><strong>消痕侠</strong><small>数字痕迹管理平台</small></span></div>
<div class="vault-auth-heading"><h1>看清你的数字痕迹，<br>从容决定下一步。</h1><p>把多来源检索、结果核验与人工跟进，放在同一个工作区。</p></div>
<div class="vault-stage"><%include file="VAULT_CORE.tmpl"/><canvas data-vault-scene aria-hidden="true"></canvas><span class="vault-scene-caption">身份核心 · 来源线索的交汇点</span></div>
<div class="vault-auth-bottom"><div class="fl-source-words"><span>SpiderFoot</span><span>Sherlock</span><span>Maigret</span><span>WhatsMyName</span><span>Holehe</span><span>HIBP</span></div><div class="vault-auth-controls"><p class="fl-story-footer">覆盖有限 · 来源透明 · 人工核验<br>消痕侠—数字痕迹管理平台</p><button id="vault-motion-toggle" class="vault-motion-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">暂停视觉动效</button></div></div></section>
<section class="fl-auth-form"><div class="fl-auth-inner"><h2>创建账号</h2><p class="fl-muted">建立你的数字痕迹工作区。</p>
% if error:
<div class="fl-notice error" role="alert">${error | h}</div>
% endif
% if success:
<div class="fl-notice" role="status">${success | h} <a href="${docroot}/login">立即登录 →</a></div>
% endif
<form method="post" action="${docroot}/register" id="reg-form">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="${csrf_token}">
<div class="fl-field"><label for="username">用户名</label><input class="fl-input" id="username" name="username" type="text" placeholder="设置用户名" minlength="3" maxlength="32" required autocomplete="username" aria-describedby="username-hint"><small id="username-hint">3–32 个字符；登录和注册均会去除首尾空格。</small></div>
<div class="fl-field"><label for="password">密码</label><div class="fl-password-wrap"><input class="fl-input" id="password" name="password" type="password" placeholder="至少 8 位，建议使用长且不重复的密码" minlength="8" required autocomplete="new-password" aria-describedby="password-hint pw-strength-text"><button class="fl-password-toggle" type="button" data-password-target="password" aria-label="显示密码" aria-pressed="false">显示</button></div><small id="password-hint">建议使用至少 12 位，并组合字母、数字和符号。</small><div class="fl-password-strength" id="pw-strength" hidden><meter id="pw-strength-meter" min="0" max="4" value="0" aria-label="密码强度提示"></meter><small id="pw-strength-text" aria-live="polite"></small></div></div>
<div class="fl-field"><label for="confirm">确认密码</label><div class="fl-password-wrap"><input class="fl-input" id="confirm" name="confirm" type="password" placeholder="再次输入密码" required autocomplete="new-password" aria-describedby="confirm-hint"><button class="fl-password-toggle" type="button" data-password-target="confirm" aria-label="显示确认密码" aria-pressed="false">显示</button></div><small class="fl-confirm-hint" id="confirm-hint" aria-live="polite"></small></div>
<button class="fl-btn primary wide" type="submit">创建账号 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
</form>
<div class="fl-auth-links"><a href="${docroot}/login">已有账号？立即登录</a><span>v${version}</span></div>
<div class="fl-auth-boundary"><p>仅查询本人或已获授权的目标。</p><p>数据源覆盖有限，检索线索需要人工核验。</p><p>申请记录需要人工跟进，不会自动删除平台内容。</p></div>
</div></section></main><script src="${docroot}/static/js/register.js?v=fluent-1" defer></script></body></html>
